  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 2 or more combat spheres, base attack bonus +6 or higher.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may maintain a second martial focus. This martial focus is gained and expended independently from the first.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Wiki Note:</strong> Remember that even with Great Focus, you can only gain Martial Focus once per round.</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc58\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
